      "familiar": "no"
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "fra-054",
    "deck": "frames",
    "text": "{business} \"I couldn't say, and wouldn't if I could.\" {dashiell} \"{fact}. Make of it what you like.\"",
